  <p class="eyebrow">01 / THE IDEA</p>
  <div><h2>Learning happens<br>hands-on.</h2><p>A home lab can be as simple as one spare machine. It is a place to explore networking, self-hosted services, and the everyday work of keeping systems running.</p></div>
</section>
